{"bookId":"MAL","bookName":"Malaquías","shortName":"Mal","version":"RVR1909","chaptersCount":4,"chapters":{"1":[{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":1,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Profecía de la palabra de Jehová contra Israel, por medio de Malaquías.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Profecía","strong":"4853"},{"word":"palabra","strong":"1697"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"contra","strong":"413"},{"word":"Israel","strong":"3478"},{"word":"medio","strong":"3027"},{"word":"Malaquías","strong":"4401"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":2,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Yo os he amado, dice Jehová; y dijisteis: ¿En qué nos amaste? ¿ No era Esaú hermano de Jacob? dice Jehová. Y amé a Jacob,","strongTokens":[{"word":"dice","strong":"157"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"559"},{"word":"y","strong":"3068"},{"word":"En","strong":"559"},{"word":"nos","strong":"4100"},{"word":"amaste","strong":"587"},{"word":"era","strong":"3808"},{"word":"hermano","strong":"6215"},{"word":"hermano","strong":"3290"},{"word":"de","strong":"251"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"5002"},{"word":"Y","strong":"3068"},{"word":"a","strong":"157"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":3,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"y a Esaú aborrecí, y convertí sus montes en desolación, y abandoné su heredad para los chacales del desierto.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Esaú","strong":"6215"},{"word":"aborrecí","strong":"8130"},{"word":"aborrecí","strong":"7760"},{"word":"montes","strong":"2022"},{"word":"desolación","strong":"8077"},{"word":"heredad","strong":"5159"},{"word":"heredad","strong":"8568"},{"word":"desierto","strong":"4057"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":4,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Cuando Edom dijere: Nos hemos empobrecido, pero volveremos a edificar lo arruinado; así ha dicho Jehová de los ejércitos: Ellos edificarán, y yo destruiré; y les llamarán territorio de impiedad, y pueblo contra el cual Jehová está indignado para siempre.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Cuando","strong":"3588"},{"word":"Edom","strong":"123"},{"word":"dijere","strong":"559"},{"word":"empobrecido","strong":"7567"},{"word":"empobrecido","strong":"7725"},{"word":"edificar","strong":"1129"},{"word":"arruinado","strong":"2723"},{"word":"así","strong":"3541"},{"word":"dicho","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"},{"word":"Ellos","strong":"1992"},{"word":"edificarán","strong":"1129"},{"word":"yo","strong":"589"},{"word":"destruiré","strong":"2040"},{"word":"llamarán","strong":"7121"},{"word":"territorio","strong":"1366"},{"word":"impiedad","strong":"7564"},{"word":"pueblo","strong":"5971"},{"word":"cual","strong":"834"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"indignado","strong":"2194"},{"word":"para","strong":"5704"},{"word":"siempre","strong":"5769"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":5,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y vuestros ojos lo verán, y diréis: Sea Jehová engrandecido más allá de los límites de Israel.","strongTokens":[{"word":"vuestros","strong":"859"},{"word":"ojos","strong":"5869"},{"word":"verán","strong":"7200"},{"word":"y","strong":"859"},{"word":"diréis","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"engrandecido","strong":"1431"},{"word":"allá","strong":"5921"},{"word":"límites","strong":"1366"},{"word":"Israel","strong":"3478"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":6,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"El hijo honra al padre, y el siervo a su señor. Si, pues, soy yo padre, ¿dónde está mi honra? y si soy señor, ¿dónde está mi temor? dice Jehová de los ejércitos a vosotros, oh sacerdotes, que menospreciáis mi nombre. Y decís: ¿En qué hemos menospreciado tu nombre?","strongTokens":[{"word":"honra","strong":"1121"},{"word":"al","strong":"3513"},{"word":"y","strong":"1"},{"word":"a","strong":"5650"},{"word":"Si","strong":"113"},{"word":"pues","strong":"518"},{"word":"padre","strong":"589"},{"word":"dónde","strong":"1"},{"word":"está","strong":"346"},{"word":"honra","strong":"589"},{"word":"y","strong":"3519"},{"word":"soy","strong":"518"},{"word":"señor","strong":"113"},{"word":"dónde","strong":"589"},{"word":"está","strong":"346"},{"word":"temor","strong":"589"},{"word":"dice","strong":"4172"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"559"},{"word":"de","strong":"3068"},{"word":"a","strong":"6635"},{"word":"que","strong":"3548"},{"word":"mi","strong":"959"},{"word":"nombre","strong":"589"},{"word":"Y","strong":"8034"},{"word":"En","strong":"559"},{"word":"hemos","strong":"4100"},{"word":"menospreciado","strong":"959"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":7,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"En que ofrecéis sobre mi altar pan inmundo. Y dijisteis: ¿En qué te hemos deshonrado? En que pensáis que la mesa de Jehová es despreciable.","strongTokens":[{"word":"sobre","strong":"5066"},{"word":"mi","strong":"5921"},{"word":"pan","strong":"4196"},{"word":"inmundo","strong":"3899"},{"word":"Y","strong":"1351"},{"word":"En","strong":"559"},{"word":"te","strong":"4100"},{"word":"En","strong":"1351"},{"word":"que","strong":"559"},{"word":"de","strong":"7979"},{"word":"es","strong":"3068"},{"word":"despreciable","strong":"959"},{"word":"despreciable","strong":"1931"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y cuando ofrecéis el animal ciego para el sacrificio, ¿no es malo? Asimismo cuando ofrecéis el cojo o el enfermo, ¿no es malo? Preséntalo,, pues, a tu príncipe; ¿acaso se agradará de ti, o «le serás acepto?» * dice Jehová de los ejércitos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"cuando","strong":"3588"},{"word":"ofrecéis","strong":"5066"},{"word":"ciego","strong":"5787"},{"word":"sacrificio","strong":"2076"},{"word":"no","strong":"369"},{"word":"malo","strong":"7451"},{"word":"cuando","strong":"3588"},{"word":"ofrecéis","strong":"5066"},{"word":"cojo","strong":"6455"},{"word":"enfermo","strong":"2470"},{"word":"no","strong":"369"},{"word":"malo","strong":"7451"},{"word":"Preséntalo","strong":"7126"},{"word":"pues","strong":"4994"},{"word":"príncipe","strong":"6346"},{"word":"agradará","strong":"7521"},{"word":"o","strong":"176"},{"word":"*","strong":"5375"},{"word":"*","strong":"6440"},{"word":"dice","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3069"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Ahora, pues, orad por el favor de Dios, para que tenga piedad de nosotros. Pero ¿cómo «podéis agradarle,» *,, si hacéis estas cosas? dice Jehová de los ejércitos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Ahora","strong":"6258"},{"word":"orad","strong":"2470"},{"word":"orad","strong":"4994"},{"word":"orad","strong":"6440"},{"word":"Dios","strong":"410"},{"word":"Dios","strong":"2603"},{"word":"nosotros","strong":"587"},{"word":"*","strong":"5375"},{"word":"si","strong":"4480"},{"word":"si","strong":"6440"},{"word":"hacéis","strong":"3027"},{"word":"hacéis","strong":"1961"},{"word":"estas","strong":"2063"},{"word":"dice","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿Quién también hay de vosotros que cierre las puertas o alumbre mi altar de balde? Yo no tengo, complacencia en vosotros, dice Jehová de los ejércitos, ni de vuestra mano aceptaré ofrenda.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Quién","strong":"4310"},{"word":"también","strong":"1571"},{"word":"cierre","strong":"5462"},{"word":"puertas","strong":"1817"},{"word":"o","strong":"3808"},{"word":"o","strong":"215"},{"word":"altar","strong":"4196"},{"word":"balde","strong":"2600"},{"word":"tengo","strong":"369"},{"word":"complacencia","strong":"2656"},{"word":"dice","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"},{"word":"ni","strong":"3808"},{"word":"mano","strong":"3027"},{"word":"aceptaré","strong":"7521"},{"word":"ofrenda","strong":"4503"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":11,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Porque desde donde el sol nace hasta donde se pone,, es grande mi nombre entre las naciones; y en todo lugar se ofrece a mi nombre incienso y ofrenda limpia, porque grande es mi nombre entre las naciones, dice Jehová de los ejércitos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"sol","strong":"8121"},{"word":"nace","strong":"4217"},{"word":"hasta","strong":"5704"},{"word":"hasta","strong":"935"},{"word":"pone","strong":"3996"},{"word":"grande","strong":"1419"},{"word":"nombre","strong":"8034"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"1471"},{"word":"todo","strong":"3605"},{"word":"lugar","strong":"4725"},{"word":"ofrece","strong":"5066"},{"word":"nombre","strong":"8034"},{"word":"incienso","strong":"6999"},{"word":"ofrenda","strong":"4503"},{"word":"limpia","strong":"2889"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"grande","strong":"1419"},{"word":"nombre","strong":"8034"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"1471"},{"word":"dice","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":12,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y vosotros lo habéis profanado cuando decís:, Inmunda es la mesa de Jehová, y cuando decís que su alimento es despreciable.","strongTokens":[{"word":"vosotros","strong":"859"},{"word":"profanado","strong":"2490"},{"word":"decís","strong":"559"},{"word":"Inmunda","strong":"1351"},{"word":"mesa","strong":"7979"},{"word":"mesa","strong":"136"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"1931"},{"word":"que","strong":"5108"},{"word":"que","strong":"959"},{"word":"su","strong":"1931"},{"word":"alimento","strong":"1931"},{"word":"es","strong":"400"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":13,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Habéis además dicho: ¡Oh, qué fastidio es esto! y me despreciáis, dice Jehová de los ejércitos; y trajisteis lo hurtado, o cojo, o enfermo, y presentasteis ofrenda. ¿ Aceptaré yo eso de vuestra mano? dice Jehová.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Oh","strong":"559"},{"word":"qué","strong":"2009"},{"word":"es","strong":"4972"},{"word":"dice","strong":"5301"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"559"},{"word":"de","strong":"3068"},{"word":"y","strong":"6635"},{"word":"y","strong":"935"},{"word":"o","strong":"1497"},{"word":"o","strong":"6455"},{"word":"y","strong":"2470"},{"word":"y","strong":"935"},{"word":"yo","strong":"7521"},{"word":"dice","strong":"3027"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"559"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":1,"verse":14,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Maldito el que engaña, el que teniendo machos en su rebaño, promete, y sacrifica a Jehová lo dañado. Porque yo soy Gran Rey, dice Jehová de los ejércitos, y mi nombre es temible entre las naciones.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Maldito","strong":"779"},{"word":"engaña","strong":"5230"},{"word":"teniendo","strong":"3426"},{"word":"machos","strong":"2145"},{"word":"rebaño","strong":"5739"},{"word":"promete","strong":"5087"},{"word":"sacrifica","strong":"2076"},{"word":"a","strong":"589"},{"word":"dañado","strong":"7843"},{"word":"dañado","strong":"136"},{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"yo","strong":"589"},{"word":"Gran","strong":"1419"},{"word":"Rey","strong":"4428"},{"word":"dice","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"},{"word":"mi","strong":"589"},{"word":"nombre","strong":"8034"},{"word":"temible","strong":"3372"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"1471"}]}],"2":[{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":2,"verse":1,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Ahora, pues, oh sacerdotes, para vosotros es este mandamiento.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Ahora","strong":"6258"},{"word":"sacerdotes","strong":"3548"},{"word":"para","strong":"413"},{"word":"para","strong":"4687"},{"word":"para","strong":"2063"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":2,"verse":2,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Si no oyereis, y si no decidís de corazón dar gloria a mi nombre, ha dicho Jehová de los ejércitos, enviaré maldición sobre vosotros, y maldeciré vuestras bendiciones; y aun las he maldecido, porque no os habéis decidido de corazón.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Si","strong":"518"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"no","strong":"7760"},{"word":"oyereis","strong":"8085"},{"word":"si","strong":"518"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"de","strong":"5921"},{"word":"corazón","strong":"3820"},{"word":"corazón","strong":"5414"},{"word":"gloria","strong":"3519"},{"word":"nombre","strong":"8034"},{"word":"dicho","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"},{"word":"enviaré","strong":"7971"},{"word":"maldición","strong":"3994"},{"word":"maldeciré","strong":"779"},{"word":"bendiciones","strong":"1293"},{"word":"aun","strong":"1571"},{"word":"maldecido","strong":"779"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"no","strong":"369"},{"word":"no","strong":"7760"},{"word":"de","strong":"5921"},{"word":"corazón","strong":"3820"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":2,"verse":3,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"He aquí, yo os dañaré la sementera, y os echaré al rostro el estiércol, el estiércol de vuestros animales sacrificados, y seréis arrojados juntamente con él.","strongTokens":[{"word":"dañaré","strong":"2005"},{"word":"dañaré","strong":"1605"},{"word":"y","strong":"2233"},{"word":"al","strong":"2219"},{"word":"rostro","strong":"5921"},{"word":"rostro","strong":"6440"},{"word":"el","strong":"6569"},{"word":"de","strong":"6569"},{"word":"y","strong":"2282"},{"word":"juntamente","strong":"5375"},{"word":"él","strong":"413"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":2,"verse":4,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y sabréis que yo os, envié este mandamiento, para que fuese mi pacto con Leví, ha dicho Jehová de los ejércitos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"sabréis","stron