 ejércitos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"labios","strong":"8193"},{"word":"sacerdote","strong":"3548"},{"word":"sacerdote","strong":"8104"},{"word":"sacerdote","strong":"1847"},{"word":"su","strong":"1931"},{"word":"boca","strong":"6310"},{"word":"buscará","strong":"1245"},{"word":"ley","strong":"8451"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"mensajero","strong":"4397"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"1931"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":2,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Mas vosotros os habéis apartado del, camino; habéis hecho tropezar a muchos en la ley; habéis corrompido el pacto de Leví, dice Jehová de los ejércitos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"vosotros","strong":"859"},{"word":"vosotros","strong":"5493"},{"word":"apartado","strong":"5620"},{"word":"del","strong":"4480"},{"word":"camino","strong":"1870"},{"word":"tropezar","strong":"3782"},{"word":"muchos","strong":"7227"},{"word":"ley","strong":"8451"},{"word":"corrompido","strong":"7843"},{"word":"pacto","strong":"1285"},{"word":"Leví","strong":"3878"},{"word":"dice","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":2,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Por tanto, yo también os, he hecho viles y bajos ante todo el pueblo, así como vosotros, no habéis guardado mis caminos, y en la ley «hacéis acepción de personas.» *,","strongTokens":[{"word":"también","strong":"589"},{"word":"os","strong":"1571"},{"word":"viles","strong":"5414"},{"word":"y","strong":"959"},{"word":"ante","strong":"8217"},{"word":"el","strong":"3605"},{"word":"así","strong":"5971"},{"word":"como","strong":"6310"},{"word":"vosotros","strong":"834"},{"word":"no","strong":"369"},{"word":"no","strong":"8104"},{"word":"no","strong":"854"},{"word":"caminos","strong":"589"},{"word":"y","strong":"1870"},{"word":"y","strong":"5375"},{"word":"y","strong":"6440"},{"word":"*","strong":"8451"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":2,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿No tenemos todos, un mismo padre? ¿No nos ha creado un mismo Dios? ¿Por qué, pues, nos portamos deslealmente el uno contra el otro, profanando el pacto de nuestros padres?","strongTokens":[{"word":"No","strong":"3808"},{"word":"todos","strong":"3605"},{"word":"un","strong":"259"},{"word":"padre","strong":"1"},{"word":"No","strong":"3808"},{"word":"nos","strong":"587"},{"word":"creado","strong":"1254"},{"word":"un","strong":"259"},{"word":"Dios","strong":"410"},{"word":"Por","strong":"4069"},{"word":"el","strong":"898"},{"word":"contra","strong":"376"},{"word":"otro","strong":"251"},{"word":"otro","strong":"2490"},{"word":"de","strong":"1285"},{"word":"padres","strong":"587"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":2,"verse":11,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Prevaricó Judá, y en Israel y en Jerusalén se ha cometido abominación; porque Judá ha profanado el santuario de Jehová que él amó, y se casó con hija de dios extraño.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Prevaricó","strong":"898"},{"word":"Judá","strong":"3063"},{"word":"Israel","strong":"3478"},{"word":"Jerusalén","strong":"3389"},{"word":"cometido","strong":"6213"},{"word":"abominación","strong":"8441"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"Judá","strong":"3063"},{"word":"profanado","strong":"2490"},{"word":"santuario","strong":"6944"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"que","strong":"834"},{"word":"amó","strong":"157"},{"word":"casó","strong":"1166"},{"word":"hija","strong":"1323"},{"word":"dios","strong":"410"},{"word":"extraño","strong":"5236"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":2,"verse":12,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Jehová cortará de las tiendas de Jacob al hombre que hiciere esto, al que vela y al que responde, y al que ofrece ofrenda a Jehová de los ejércitos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3069"},