"6635"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":3,"verse":2,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿Y quién podrá soportar el tiempo de su venida? ¿o quién podrá estar en pie cuando él se manifieste? Porque él es como fuego purificador, y como jabón de lavadores.","strongTokens":[{"word":"quién","strong":"4310"},{"word":"quién","strong":"3557"},{"word":"tiempo","strong":"3117"},{"word":"tiempo","strong":"935"},{"word":"su","strong":"1931"},{"word":"quién","strong":"4310"},{"word":"cuando","strong":"5975"},{"word":"se","strong":"1931"},{"word":"Porque","strong":"7200"},{"word":"él","strong":"3588"},{"word":"es","strong":"1931"},{"word":"purificador","strong":"784"},{"word":"y","strong":"6884"},{"word":"de","strong":"1287"},{"word":"de","strong":"3526"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":3,"verse":3,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y se sentará para afinar y limpiar la plata; porque limpiará a los hijos de Leví, los afinará como a oro y como a plata, y traerán a Jehová ofrenda en justicia.","strongTokens":[{"word":"sentará","strong":"3427"},{"word":"afinar","strong":"6884"},{"word":"limpiar","strong":"2891"},{"word":"plata","strong":"3701"},{"word":"limpiará","strong":"2891"},{"word":"hijos","strong":"1121"},{"word":"Leví","strong":"3878"},{"word":"afinará","strong":"2212"},{"word":"oro","strong":"2091"},{"word":"plata","strong":"3701"},{"word":"y","strong":"1961"},{"word":"traerán","strong":"5066"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ofrenda","strong":"4503"},{"word":"justicia","strong":"6666"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":3,"verse":4,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y será grata a Jehová la ofrenda de Judá y de Jerusalén, como en los días pasados, y como en los años antiguos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"grata","strong":"6149"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ofrenda","strong":"4503"},{"word":"Judá","strong":"3063"},{"word":"Jerusalén","strong":"3389"},{"word":"días","strong":"3117"},{"word":"pasados","strong":"5769"},{"word":"años","strong":"8141"},{"word":"años","strong":"6931"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":3,"verse":5,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y vendré a vosotros para juicio; y seré pronto testigo contra los hechiceros y adúlteros, contra los que juran mentira, y los que defraudan en su salario al jornalero, a la viuda y al huérfano, y los que hacen injusticia al extranjero, no teniendo temor de mí, dice Jehová de los ejércitos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"vendré","strong":"7126"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"juicio","strong":"4941"},{"word":"seré","strong":"1961"},{"word":"pronto","strong":"4116"},{"word":"testigo","strong":"5707"},{"word":"hechiceros","strong":"3784"},{"word":"adúlteros","strong":"5003"},{"word":"adúlteros","strong":"7650"},{"word":"mentira","strong":"8267"},{"word":"defraudan","strong":"6231"},{"word":"salario","strong":"7939"},{"word":"jornalero","strong":"7916"},{"word":"viuda","strong":"490"},{"word":"huérfano","strong":"3490"},{"word":"al","strong":"5186"},{"word":"extranjero","strong":"1616"},{"word":"teniendo","strong":"3808"},{"word":"de","strong":"3372"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"559"},{"word":"de","strong":"3068"},{"word":"de","strong":"6635"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":3,"verse":6,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Porque yo Jehová no cambio; por esto, hijos de Jacob, no habéis sido consumidos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"yo","strong":"589"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"cambio","strong":"8138"},{"word":"esto","strong":"859"},{"word":"hijos","strong":"1121"},{"word":"hijos","strong":"3290"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"consumidos","strong":"3615"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":3,"verse":7,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Desde los días de vuestros padres os habéis apartado de mis leyes, y no las guardasteis. Volveos a mí, y yo me volveré a vosotros, ha dicho Jehová de los ejércitos. Mas dijisteis: ¿En qué hemos de volvernos?","strongTokens":[{"word":"días","strong":"3117"},{"word":"días","strong":"5493"},{"word":"padres","strong":"1"},{"word":"apartado","strong":"5620"},{"word":"leyes","strong":"2706"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"no","strong":"8104"},{"word":"no","strong":"7725"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"a","strong":"7725"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"dicho","strong":"559"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"},{"word":"dijisteis","strong":"559"},{"word":"qué","strong":"4100"},{"word":"qué","strong":"7725"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":3,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿Robará el hombre a Dios? Pues vosotros me habéis robado. Y dijisteis: ¿En qué te hemos robado? En vuestros diezmos y ofrendas.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Robará","strong":"6906"},{"word":"Robará","strong":"120"},{"word":"Dios","strong":"430"},{"word":"Pues","strong":"3588"},{"word":"vosotros","strong":"859"},{"word":"robado","strong":"6906"},{"word":"dijisteis","strong":"559"},{"word":"qué","strong":"4100"},{"word":"te","strong":"859"},{"word":"robado","strong":"6906"},{"word":"diezmos","strong":"4643"},{"word":"ofrendas","strong":"8641"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":3,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Malditos sois con maldición, porque vosotros, la nación toda,, me habéis robado.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Malditos","strong":"779"},{"word":"sois","strong":"859"},{"word":"maldición","strong":"3994"},{"word":"vosotros","strong":"859"},{"word":"nación","strong":"1471"},{"word":"toda","strong":"3605"},{"word":"robado","strong":"6906"}]},{"bookId":"MAL","chapter":3,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Traed todos los diezmos al alfolí y haya alimento en mi casa; y probadme, ahora en esto, dice Jehová de los ejércitos, si no os abriré las ventanas de los cielos, y derramaré sobre vosotros bendición hasta que sobreabunde."